<title>INDIA: India repos auction cut-off steady at 5.0 percent.</title>
<headline>India repos auction cut-off steady at 5.0 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Saturday it maintained the cut-off at five percent at its three-day repos auction of government of India securities.</p>
<p>It said it received nine bids for 14.6 billion rupees of which it accepted eight for 14.4 billion.</p>
<p>The weighted-average cut-off worked out to 4.9854 percent, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
